{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>Sing.</b> Like <i>the choice fruits of the land</i> (Genesis 43:11) [Heb. <b>מזמרת</b>]; the meaning is: give a song of praiseworthy speech to the Name." "<b>Is made known.</b> Pu'al of the heavy [stem] that is augmented." "<b>That exaltation.</b> Feminine in form, and the tav is for the feminine collective."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:53:31.766998139Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}